# Settings, Classic Atari page (Desktop session: DESK=1; the card has the sample /atari.ini,
# sdfiles/atari.ini). Two values changed, Save, the restart alert, Later; then
# build/run-pic/atari.ini must be tests/atari-ini.txt.
#   DESK=1 sh tests/shots.sh EMU SD classic 16 7 9.8 12 14.5
# The pointer starts at (320, 180); moves of at most 100. The panel's content is at
# (140, 36) on the screen (0.24: 40 before). (A key event: the emulator needs one.)
1000 {de1}{ue1}
# Horizon menu (40, 8) > Settings... (0.14: its second item, y 38)
3000 M -100:-100:0:0
+50 M -100:-72:0:0
+50 M -80:0:0:0
+300 M 0:0:0:1
+100 M 0:0:0:0
+500 M 0:30:0:0
+300 M 0:0:0:1
+100 M 0:0:0:0
# the "Classic Atari" page button (312, 58)
6000 M 100:20:0:0
+50 M 100:0:0:0
+50 M 72:0:0:0
+300 M 0:0:0:1
+100 M 0:0:0:0
# Memory 320 KB (430, 90; 0.16: two buttons, 128 and 320)
8000 M 100:32:0:0
+50 M 18:0:0:0
+300 M 0:0:0:1
+100 M 0:0:0:0
# Scanlines 50% (400, 162; 0.27: the stereo row above it is gone)
8800 M -30:72:0:0
+300 M 0:0:0:1
+100 M 0:0:0:0
# Save (456, 334; 0.18: the panel is a row taller; 0.24: one more, the Screen saver)
10500 M 56:100:0:0
+50 M 0:72:0:0
+300 M 0:0:0:1
+100 M 0:0:0:0
# the alert: Later (298, 209)
13000 M -100:-100:0:0
+50 M -58:-25:0:0
+300 M 0:0:0:1
+100 M 0:0:0:0
